.identifiers

# Single-use working files: session prompts, handovers, scratch notes.
#
# They are messages, not artifacts. A prompt for the next session is stale the
# moment that session ends, and committing one puts a second document about the
# same component next to the spec — which is how two documents come to disagree
# about a contract a human already merged.
#
# Write them here, paste them into the chat, let them rot.
.scratch/

# Byproducts of a FAILING vitest browser test: a screenshot of the page, and the
# same image again as a reporter attachment. Debugging aids with a lifetime of
# one run — never a review artifact. Both are pointed here rather than at their
# defaults, because the screenshot default is `src/__screenshots__/`, which puts
# untracked binaries inside a tracked source directory.
.vitest-screenshots/
.vitest-attachments/
